From 6a67edb7b3f9d1f72f655c91c4c80fffe32b7ff3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:45:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Enemy (engine.wgsl scar_tough) + Look's draw.rs: the Grudge
 reads as hits shrugged off

Squad's film (#847): holding one spot on planet 7 for 3:00, the HUD's share
of the slime on full scar read 0%, 0%, 1%. On lavapipe (run seed 1, 8
soldiers at 760,436, no twist or mini-boss) the share at 2:00 was 0.5% at
scar_tough_full 500, 0.6% at 250, 0.9% at 500 with scar_gain 4x, 1.5% with
a wider alarm (alarm_keep 0.995): the scar is the kill zone, a sliver of
85k-167k walkers. Direction (11-25) picked reading the trait where it
acts.

The engine counts each blow scar tissue turns aside in wstat[14] (the
mould grid moves to word 15, WSTAT_BYTES 60). GpuWorld keeps running
totals of those and the kills (the shots' own kills plus the struck
counter's bursts and fire) with a sample a readout, and
GpuWorld::shrugged(ticks) gives a window. The Grudge's HUD tell reads
"N% of hits shrugged off by scar" over the last 10 s. Headless logs it
once a second. The same film: 21% at 0:30, 47% at 0:40, 47-52% to 3:00.

The GPU test scar_tissue_shrugs_off_half_the_blows now also asserts no
blow shrugged off with scar tissue off and about half with it on. No
number changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
